## Local databases
# Modules 03, 04 and 09 create a SQLite file on first run. It is generated by
# EnsureCreated(), so it must never be committed -- a stale one with an old
# schema is worse than none at all.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
!Thumbs.db

